    <string name="main_make_up_explain">One make-up pass fills a missed check-in day, and you get that slot\'s reward (Primogems, etc.) too.\n\nMake-up passes come from simple tasks in the HoYoLAB check-in event (like visiting a link). Tap \'Make up\' and the app finishes the tasks it can for you, gets the pass and fills the day right away.\n\nHoYoLAB sets how many make-ups you can do per day and per month. Once they\'re used up, you can try again later.</string>
